# What the container build does not need to see.
#
# The context is the whole repository because the CMake build reads `VERSION` from
# the parent directory and installs files from `packaging/`, and because the
# install rules carry `docs/` into the image for the documentation browser.
# `docs` is therefore not excluded: without it `cmake --install` fails with
# "file INSTALL cannot find .../docs" rather than shipping a smaller image. These
# are the parts that cost transfer time without contributing anything to the
# image.

.git
.github
.venv
native/build
native/build-debug
native/build-sanitised
native/build-ubsan
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
*.png
!packaging/linux/*.png
tws_matrix_scratch.txt
